flowchart LR
  CAT[G03 catalog/source reconcile] --> LOAD[Load G03/G04/G05]
  LOAD --> HASH{Hashes valid?}
  HASH -- no --> FAIL[Fail closed]
  HASH -- yes --> DISCOVER[Discover projects + ownership]
  DISCOVER --> GRAPH[Build direct/transitive graph]
  GRAPH --> SOURCE[Analyze imports/declarations/types]
  SOURCE --> RULES[Apply ring/ownership/payload rules]
  RULES --> BASE{B4 baseline: 0 entries}
  BASE -- finding --> FAIL
  BASE -- clean --> REPORT[Publish LayerGuard report]
  REPORT --> SEM[G03/G05 semantic reports stay separate]
